---
import SectionHead from '@components/SectionHead.astro';

const FIGURES = [
    { label: '60岁以上老年人', note: '占全国总人口 21.1%', value: '2.97亿' },
    { label: '65岁以上老年人', note: '占全国总人口 15.4%', value: '2.17亿' },
    { label: '2035年60岁及以上人口预计规模', note: '国家进入重度老龄化阶段', value: '4亿' },
];
---

<section
    class="services-wellness-intro section"
    aria-labelledby="services-wellness-intro-title"
>
    <div class="shell services-wellness-intro__grid">
        <div data-scroll="left">
            <SectionHead
                eyebrow="Aging China"
                headingId="services-wellness-intro-title"
            >
                全国性养老服务提供商
                <Fragment slot="text">
                    <p>人口老龄化已是个不争的事实，积极应对人口老龄化将驱动未来30年的经济社会发展。</p>
                </Fragment>
            </SectionHead>
            <div class="prose">
                <p>截至2023年底，我国60岁以上老年人达到2.97亿，占总人口的21.1%。其中65岁以上老年人达到2.17亿，占总人口的15.4%。到2035年，我国60岁及以上老年人口预计将突破4亿，国家进入重度老龄化阶段。</p>
                <p>面对如此艰巨复杂的养老需求，惠泽从2012年开始布局线下养老机构和线上养老服务平台，目前旗下有40多家线下实体机构，总床位15000张。</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <ul
            class="services-wellness-intro__figures"
            data-scroll="right"
            data-scroll-stagger
        >
            {FIGURES.map(figure => (
                <li class="card services-wellness-intro__figure">
                    <p class="services-wellness-intro__value">{figure.value}</p>
                    <p class="services-wellness-intro__label">{figure.label}</p>
                    <p class="services-wellness-intro__note">{figure.note}</p>
                </li>
            ))}
        </ul>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .services-wellness-intro__figure {
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.375rem;
    }

    .services-wellness-intro__figures {
        display: grid;
        gap: 1.125rem;
        list-style: none;
        padding: 0;
    }

    .services-wellness-intro__grid {
        align-items: center;
        display: grid;
        gap: clamp(2.5rem, calc(1.83rem + 3.33vw), 4.5rem);
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .services-wellness-intro__label {
        color: var(--color-pine);
        font-size: 0.97rem;
        font-weight: 500;
    }

    .services-wellness-intro__note {
        color: var(--color-sage);
        font-size: 0.84rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }

    .services-wellness-intro__value {
        color: var(--color-jade);
        font-family: var(--font-display);
        font-size: clamp(2rem, calc(1.67rem + 1.67vw), 3rem);
        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 1;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
        .services-wellness-intro__figures {
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(15rem, 1fr));
        }

        .services-wellness-intro__grid {
            grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
        }
    }

</style>
